{"path":"io/fpos/state","title":"std::fpos<State>::state","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::fpos&lt;State&gt;::</span>state","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/io/fpos/state","section":"io","kind":"page","summary":"Manages the file position state.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">State state<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">void</span> state<span class=\"br0\">(</span> State st <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Manages the file position state.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Returns the value of the file position state.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Replaces the file position state with the value of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">st</span></code>.</div>\n<p>For the specializations of <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/io/fpos\">std::fpos</a></span> that are used in the standard library, <code>State</code> is always <span class=\"t-lc\"><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/multibyte/mbstate_t\">std::mbstate_t</a></span>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> st\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> new value for the state\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> The current value of the <code>fpos</code> state.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> (none)</div>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cwchar&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;sstream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/basic_istringstream\"><span class=\"kw1752\">std::<span class=\"me2\">istringstream</span></span></a> s<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"test\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/multibyte/mbstate_t\"><span class=\"kw1187\">std::<span class=\"me2\">mbstate_t</span></span></a> st <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> s.<span class=\"me1\">tellg</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>.<span class=\"me1\">state</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/multibyte/mbsinit\"><span class=\"kw1175\">std::<span class=\"me2\">mbsinit</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span>st<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"The stream is in the initial shift state<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>The stream is in the initial shift state</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Defect_reports\">Defect reports</h3>\n<p>The following behavior-changing defect reports were applied retroactively to previously published C++ standards.\n</p>\n<table class=\"dsctable\">\n<tr>\n<th>DR\n</th>\n<th>Applied to\n</th>\n<th>Behavior as published\n</th>\n<th>Correct behavior\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cplusplus.github.io/LWG/issue441\" data-external=\"1\">LWG 441</a>\n</td>\n<td>C++98\n</td>\n<td>overload <span class=\"t-v\">(1)</span> was not declared <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">const</span></span> (it is <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">const</span></span> in the <a href=\"/w/cpp/header/ios\">synopsis</a>)\n</td>\n<td>added <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">const</span></span>\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/multibyte/mbstate_t\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>mbstate_t</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  conversion state information necessary to iterate multibyte character strings <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(class)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"Defect reports","id":"Defect_reports"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"io","title":"Input/output library"},{"path":"io/fpos","title":"std::fpos"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::fpos<State>::state","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations. Manages the file position state."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"st"},{"label":"Return value","note":"The current value of the fpos state."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"mbstate_t","note":"conversion state information necessary to iterate multibyte character strings"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":162,"codeBlockCount":2}
